{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10282090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1028209001:1":{"text":"風よ！ボクの声を聞いてくれ……万物の知らせを我にもたらしたまえ……","source_cn":"风啊，我请求您倾听我的声音……带给我万物的讯息……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DD7FA2BFA3AB44D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028209002:1":{"text":"風語りの話し方って、こんな感じでいいのかな……","source_cn":"风语者是这样和风对话的吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x173B6718AA3E5BF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028209003:0":{"text":"でも、どうして風の声が聞こえないんだろう……どこか間違ってるのかな？","source_cn":"但是，为什么听不到风的声音……是我哪里做得不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A916F6D4A6E139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028210001:1":{"text":"ねえ、もし風の声が聞こえたら、学園に戻る気になるかな？","source_cn":"你说，如果他听到风的声音，是不是就愿意回学院了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E9904759B693A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028210002:0":{"text":"ロンロン、たまには良い事を言うじゃないの！","source_cn":"满满终于说了一句聪明话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D199DE1F880B120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028210003:0":{"text":"まあね……あっ、そうだ！マスター、風の元素を召喚してもらえませんか？","source_cn":"唔……嗯，有了！主人，拜托你为他召唤一只风元素好不好？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x93B2DC5326CB9CC9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まあね……あっ、そうだ！マスター、風の元素を召喚してもらえませんか？","female":"まあね……あっ、そうだ！マスター、風の元素を召喚してもらえませんか？","variant_male_record_index":"110962","variant_female_record_index":"110963","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028210004:1":{"text":"風の元素が現れれば、彼の思いが伝わったってことになります！そうすれば安心して学校に戻るかもしれないですよね？","source_cn":"风元素出现，也算是他的交流成功了吧！也许这样他就能安心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA9E581994C05CA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1028210004":{"text":"風の元素が現れれば、彼の思いが伝わったってことになります！そうすれば安心して学校に戻るかもしれないですよね？","source_cn":"风元素出现，也算是他的交流成功了吧！也许这样他就能安心回学校去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA9E581994C05CA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028210005:0":{"text":"ほら！ランディが風の元素を見てますよ！","source_cn":"瞧，兰迪看到风元素了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20C1EDBD8FBC03AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028210006:0":{"text":"すごく嬉しそうです！ヘヘッ！きっとこれで満足するでしょう！","source_cn":"他看上去很高兴！嘿嘿，这下他该心满意足了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37008551480B8691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1028211001:0":{"text":"風……風だ！ボ……ボクの召喚が聞こえたんだね？","source_cn":"风……是风！你……你听到我的召唤了，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E05F5F0FE07C582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1028211002:1":{"text":"スゴいぞ！ミサタ様は本当に風語りの能力を授けてくれたんだ！","source_cn":"太棒了！弥萨忒真的赐予了我风语天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99CEA41BFF8933B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028211003:1":{"text":"さっそくだけど、パパとママにメッセージを伝えてくれないかな？何にしようか……そうだ！ボクは風と話ができるようになったから、大きくなったら、立派な……","source_cn":"请你传个信息给我的爸爸妈妈好不好？就说……对，就说我现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040187CAF883ECB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028211004:0":{"text":"……あれ？どんどん風が強くなってきた。風よ！ボクの話を聞いてくれ！少し落ち着くんだ……","source_cn":"……嗯？怎么风越来越大了，风啊，聆听我的话语，请你不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C10DBE564E9B741","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1028211005:0":{"text":"風の元素はなんだかご機嫌斜めみたいですよ……","source_cn":"满满怎么觉得风元素有点不太高兴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x448220F6EF16693B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1028211006:0":{"text":"大変！彼はまったく風の言葉が話せないんでしたわ。もしかすると風の元素はケンカを売られてると思ったのかも！","source_cn":"糟了，他根本不会风语。这样“沟通”，风元素可能会觉得他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC338DC0DB92D9209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1028211007:0":{"text":"どうなってるんだ……お願いだ！ボクの話を――","source_cn":"怎么回事……听我、听我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF59359E25801F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1028211008:0":{"text":"うわあ！こっちへ来るなー！！","source_cn":"别、别过来——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB61BFF461B718087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1028211009:0":{"text":"マズい！風の元素が暴れだしました！早く！早く風の元素をとめないと！","source_cn":"不好，风元素狂暴了！快、快阻止它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD09E1C7E16E18C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:41:10282223:0":{"text":"あなたが召喚した風の元素を見て、ランディはとても嬉しそうだ。","source_cn":"兰迪看到了你召唤出来的风元素，似乎非常高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE917D9528FF53783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"（笑いを堪えて、風の元素を召喚する）","source_cn":"（忍住笑，召唤风元素）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB04AAF0E62944DCC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（笑いを堪えて、風の元素を召喚する）","female":"（笑いを堪えて、風の元素を召喚する）","variant_male_record_index":"61234","variant_female_record_index":"61235","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:1:2":{"text":"（期待せずに風の元素を召喚する）","source_cn":"（不抱希望地召唤风元素）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC554F42486C1832C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（期待せずに風の元素を召喚する）","female":"（期待せずに風の元素を召喚する）","variant_male_record_index":"61236","variant_female_record_index":"61237","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:42:10282222:0":{"text":"あなたはロンロンやメイメイと一緒に、はらはらしながら近くでランディを見守った。","source_cn":"你和满满、漫漫藏在不远处，担忧地观察着兰迪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2C561C98917C03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:10282221:0":{"text":"空き地にやって来たランディは、もう一度儀式の準備を行った。","source_cn":"兰迪来到一片空地上，再一次布置好了仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5693460AA6A254","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兰迪":{"text":"ランディ","source":"兰迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":37,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}